## Setup Commands (Run These)

```bash
# 1. Create structure
mkdir -p privacy-vision-agent/extension/{workers,lib,wasm,models,icons}
mkdir -p privacy-vision-agent/server

# 2. Save all files above into their paths

# 3. Install extension dependencies
cd privacy-vision-agent/extension
npm init -y
npm install @huggingface/transformers @mediapipe/tasks-vision

# 4. Copy Transformers.js into extension
mkdir -p lib/transformers
cp node_modules/@huggingface/transformers/dist/transformers.js lib/transformers/
cp node_modules/@huggingface/transformers/dist/*.wasm lib/transformers/ 2>/dev/null || true

# 5. Copy MediaPipe WASM
cp node_modules/@mediapipe/tasks-vision/wasm/* wasm/

# 6. Download BlazeFace model
curl -L -o models/blaze_face_short_range.tflite \
  https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_detector/blaze_face_short_range/float16/1/blaze_face_short_range.tflite

# 7. Load extension in Chrome
#    chrome://extensions/ → Developer mode → Load unpacked → select extension/

# 8. Start server
cd ../../server
docker-compose up
